(7271878, 1131549, 176839, '<td valign="top">Thank you sooooo much all who voted and commented, this was sitting at 6.9 this morning AEST and then started to free fall.....I have access to  many retired people in our church, and due to my loud and infectious nature I can ask most of these beautiful people to play act and be my models, they love that I ask them to do silly stuff, one of my closest friends in church is a lady of 92 years, she will be my model next week for some street portraiture work. I think my flirtatious and naughty nature makes them all feel young, I don''t see these my friends as old people, I see them as people in their  mid 50s like myself. we have sooooo much fun doing photo shoots, my aim is to do some really funny  and  naughty photos with my 92 years young friend. God''s Blessings to you all.</td>', 'Thank you sooooo much all who voted and commented, this was sitting at 6.9 this morning AEST and then started to free fall.....I have access to  many retired people in our church, and due to my loud and infectious nature I can ask most of these beautiful people to play act and be my models, they love that I ask them to do silly stuff, one of my closest friends in church is a lady of 92 years, she will be my model next week for some street portraiture work. I think my flirtatious and naughty nature makes them all feel young, I don''t see these my friends as old people, I see them as people in their  mid 50s like myself. we have sooooo much fun doing photo shoots, my aim is to do some really funny  and  naughty photos with my 92 years young friend. God''s Blessings to you all.', '2014-10-10 01:55:15.000000', NULL, 0),
