(7271904, 1131549, 176839, '<td valign="top">lol Marion these are my friends Keith and Heather. Keith is 84 years young, and still plays a round of golf with two other young fellas of his age and myself at Rowville....I say to them, that I am their seeing eye dog, I have to find the ball for them as they can''t see to far...thank  God they don''t hit too far...hehehehe. He is also a keen painter and photographer, his paintings have won first place at the Dandenong show. The wifey <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=34114" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">naomik</a> and self are starting a camera club at our church, average age 80+....the wife and self bring the average age down a bit.</td>', 'lol Marion these are my friends Keith and Heather. Keith is 84 years young, and still plays a round of golf with two other young fellas of his age and myself at Rowville....I say to them, that I am their seeing eye dog, I have to find the ball for them as they can''t see to far...thank  God they don''t hit too far...hehehehe. He is also a keen painter and photographer, his paintings have won first place at the Dandenong show. The wifey  naomik and self are starting a camera club at our church, average age 80+....the wife and self bring the average age down a bit.', '2014-10-10 03:56:10.000000', NULL, 0),
